    <detaileddescription>
<sect1 id="structthemis_1_1process_1_1_light_retrieval_result_1resource_tracking">
<title>Resource Tracking</title><para>The result includes metrics about resource consumption during retrieval:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>retrieval_time_ms:</computeroutput> Time spent in retrieval operations.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>context_size_bytes:</computeroutput> Actual size of the assembled context.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>resource_exhaustion_reason:</computeroutput> If set, indicates graceful degradation occurred. Examples: &quot;max_context_size_exceeded&quot;, &quot;retrieval_timeout&quot;, &quot;no_results_found&quot;. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
